Concentration and Health Risk Assessment of Selected
Heavy Metals (HMs) in African spinach (Amaranthus
hybridus) and Tomato (Solanum lycopersicum) Grown
around Ashaka Community, Gombe State, Nigeria


Malik Isola Fatai1*, Musa Ibrahim1, Musa Adamu Ibrahim1, Bitrus Jessy Ndriza1,
Emmanuel Okoriko Matthew1, Mubarak Belerebe Saheed1 and Umoren Otoh
Dayo2
     1
         Department of Biology, University of Maiduguri, P. M.B. 1069, Maiduguri, Nigeria
     2
