    YIELD OF NITRATE ACCUMULATIONS IN SPINACH (SPINACIA
     OLRACEA L.), WITH DIFFERENT FERTILIZATION SYSTEMS
        Vildana Jogić1*, Husnija Kudić1, Sanda Stanivuković2, Jelena Nikitović2
1
 University of Bihac, Biotechnical Faculty, Marjanovica bb, Bihac, Bosnia and Herzegovina,
