+## Verification notes
+
+- DOI and title were taken from the PDF first page, not inferred from the filename.
+- The PDF filename is a spinach Pb gap candidate, but the paper also reports tomato and the metals Cu, Ni, Zn, Cd, Cr, and Pb.
